{{Quote|You see, unless you have the twelve eyes of a Vuvrian, most people can only focus on one thing at a time.|[[Hondo Ohnaka]]|<ref name="Pirate's Price">''[[Pirate's Price]]''</ref>}}
'''Vuvrians''' were a [[Sentience|sentient]] [[species]] of [[humanoid]]s whose oblong, [[Insectoid|insectile]] head featured twelve [[eye]]s and two long [[antenna]]-like appendages. [[Homeworld|Hailing]] from [[Vurdon Ka]], they never established any colony world. Thanks to their heightened senses, Vuvrians were exceptionally perceptive. They were renowned across [[the galaxy]] for their skills in [[Diplomat|diplomacy]], sales, and negotiation, and many of them excelled as [[Jedi]].<ref name="Alien Archive" /> In [[1 BBY]],<ref name="Episode IV Date">{{FilmDate|IV|1}}</ref> a Vuvrian named [[Wioslea]]<ref name="Geektionary">''[[Star Wars: Geektionary: The Galaxy from A - Z]]''</ref> bought [[Luke Skywalker]]'s [[x-34 landspeeder]] in [[Mos Eisley]], [[Tatooine]].<ref name="Episode IV" />

